  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dominican Republic Public Expenditures Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The Fund Development Objective is to support the Ministry of Finance and other agencies within the Government of the Dominican Republic in their efforts to improve public expenditure management.
 
 Specifically, the objectives of the activities to be financed by the TF are to: (i) Design and implement and integrate multiyear planning and budgeting; (ii) Design and implement a Single Treasury Account for the central administration; and (iii) Improve public sector procurement policies and practices.
 
 These address some of the main weaknesses identified in the PEFA (Public Expenditure and Financial Accountability) assessments in 2007 and 2010, with the objective of improving the scores in the 2014 PEFA.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
